    <briefdescription>
<para>Immutable value object carrying the identity of a single tracing span. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>IDs are represented as 64-bit unsigned integers (compatible with OpenTelemetry W3C trace-context encoding). <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1modules_1_1_trace_context_1ac231782052d1c7d5cdca7db9323bbba8" kindref="member">generate()</ref></computeroutput> produces a new root context with a unique trace ID; <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1modules_1_1_trace_context_1a6e9dc18463396fc2d046fb215e312e14" kindref="member">child()</ref></computeroutput> derives a child span that shares the parent&apos;s trace ID.</para>
<para>Ownership contract: <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1modules_1_1_trace_context" kindref="compound">TraceContext</ref></computeroutput> is cheap to copy (two uint64_t + one uint64_t parent ID + one std::string operation name ≤ SSO threshold). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
